+# Upgrading nanoid 3 -> 5: not applied (migration notes)
+
+Status: draft, not merged.
+
+## What changes
+nanoid 4 and 5 are ESM-only. `require('nanoid')` throws `ERR_REQUIRE_ESM`.
+
+## What breaks here
+- `apps/dashboard/scripts/seed-demo.cjs` loads it with `require()`, and `apps/dashboard/scripts/check_module_format.sh` fails at version 5.
+- See `docs/decisions/0004-pin-nanoid-commonjs.md`.
+
+## Migration steps
+1. Convert `seed-demo.cjs` to ESM (`.mjs`, `import { nanoid } from "nanoid"`) and update its callers.
+2. Bump `nanoid` to the new major in `apps/dashboard/package.json` and the lockfile.
+3. Run `bash apps/dashboard/scripts/check_module_format.sh` (update its pinned list) and `make test`.
+
+## Risk
+Low runtime risk (ids only), but it is a breaking change to our Node tooling, so it needs its own PR.
